@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    The sign-in shell: no header, no sidebar, no account menu — there is no account yet.

    It does not call into JS to apply the theme: App.razor's pre-paint script already did.

    `.login-shell` lives in app.css as a fixed scrollable grid so the open column centres at
    any viewport height without clipping on a short one.
*@
<div class="login-shell">
    @Body
</div>
